**/bin/

# Monorepo context (servekit root): the Go build needs testkit-service plus the
# locally replaced checkouts (go.mod replace) — user/license/telemetry-service.
# Exclude the other siblings and everything frontend-related to keep the
# context small.
/download-proxy/
/go-common/
/gid-service/
/message-service/
/storage-service/
/specs/
/docs/
/dev-skills/
/.zcode/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/web/
**/api/swagger/
